# Keep the Rust server out of the client (Vercel) upload, EXCEPT the one file the
# client imports at build time: spec 0102 makes server/src/engine/languages.json
# the single source of truth for the language union (imported by
# client/src/scripts/langmap.ts; the Rust backend embeds the same file). gitignore
# semantics forbid re-including a file whose parent dir is excluded, so we ignore
# each level's *contents* and re-include the path down to the file. Don't collapse
# this back to a bare `server/` — that re-breaks the Astro build (Rollup can't
# resolve the import) and the client deploy fails.
server/*
!server/src
server/src/*
!server/src/engine
server/src/engine/*
!server/src/engine/languages.json
.claude/
CLAUDE_CODE_PROMPT.md
CLAUDE_CODE_PROMPT_V2.md
